# All CLAUDE.md files except root and home/.claude/ (tracked) — explicit allowlist
**/CLAUDE.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/home/.claude/CLAUDE.md

# Serena MCP cache
.serena/

# Codex sandbox env (machine-local)
/.codex/environments/environment.toml

# understand-anything: nothing under here is tracked any more. The committed
# graph/fingerprints/meta went stale silently — the last index was generated
# 2026-05-23 against a commit no longer in history, and 194 of its 246 indexed
# paths (78%) had ceased to exist, still describing chezmoi templates, a lab-mac
# host, and an aws_sso capability. A stale index is worse than no index: it reads
# as current. Regenerate on demand instead of committing a snapshot that rots.
.understand-anything/
.codegraph/
.agents/

# Nix build artifacts
# `result` symlinks left by `nix build` / `darwin-rebuild build`, and the
# per-directory direnv cache (`use flake`). flake.lock stays tracked.
result
result-*
.direnv/
.direnv

# Rendered 1Password targets must never enter the repository. Only their
# adjacent *.tpl sources and the exact-reference policy are tracked.
/home/.config/zsh/.personal.env
# ~/.ssh/config is now a TRACKED universal base (home/.ssh/config), not a
# rendered secret. Only the tier-2 personal fragment is op-rendered.
/home/.ssh/config.d/10-homelab.conf
